---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BusinessForm from "../components/BusinessForm";
---

<Layout
  title="Building with AetherHeal"
  description="Dr. Jee Hoon Ju’s work as founder of AetherHeal, exploring AI, communication and the work around clinical care."
>
  <div class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Founder’s work</p>
    <h1>
      Technology,
      <br />
      with <em>purpose.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Better tools begin with a close understanding of the people who use them.
    </p>
  </div>
  <section class="wrap section rule grid-2">
    <div>
      <h2>AetherHeal.</h2>
      <p class="eyebrow">Founder · AetherHeal Global Inc.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="large-copy">
        Working at the intersection of medicine, communication and AI.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        My clinical work raises practical questions about how information moves,
        how people understand one another, and where useful tools can reduce
        friction. AetherHeal is the company through which I explore and build
        around these questions.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Clinical AI is assistive. Interpretation and treatment decisions remain
        with physicians. A product concept or development milestone is not
        evidence of clinical effectiveness.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://aetherheal.com/">
        Visit AetherHeal ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section rule grid-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Communication</p>
      <h2>DockieTalkie.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lead">
        Exploring the language and information gaps people encounter around
        medical care.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        See the current product website for its available features and scope.
        Translation and shared experiences support communication; they do not
        establish treatment suitability.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://dockietalkie.app/en">
        Explore DockieTalkie ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section rule grid-2">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">An open record</p>
      <h2>
        Learning,
        <br />
        <em>in public.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lead">
        The Founder’s Errata records positions I have changed, what I now think,
        and why.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        The original entries remain available at their existing addresses.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/errata/">
        Read the Founder’s Errata ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section rule" id="contact">
    <div style="max-width:760px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Business & collaboration</p>
      <h2>Start a conversation.</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Partnerships, research conversations and speaking inquiries. For
        treatment or appointments, please use{" "}
        <a class="text-link" href="/book/">
          clinic booking
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <BusinessForm client:visible />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
